  "identifier": "spezi",
  "name": "Spezi",
  "description": "Open-source Swift framework for rapid development of modular, interoperable digital health applications on iOS and macOS. Provides reusable components for onboarding, consent management, HealthKit integration, questionnaires (ResearchKit-compatible), account management, and FHIR data exchange (via SpeziFHIR). Designed for clinical research apps, digital therapeutics, and patient-facing health tools.",
