  "mach:judgement": "Assess",
  "mach:judgementReason": "The most structured open-source framework available for building clinical-grade iOS digital health apps. 248 stars, 49 releases, and active maintenance from Stanford Biodesign Digital Health. Modular ecosystem (SpeziFHIR, SpeziLLM, SpeziHealthKit, etc.) enables rapid composition of research and patient-facing apps aligned with FHIR R4. Constraint: Swift/iOS only — not applicable to Android, web, or backend systems. Best evaluated by teams building iOS research apps or patient engagement tools.",
